  "description": "Harness-seeded DC + domain-joined member V2 template. One forest (smoke.lab / SMOKE): a FirstDomainController VM on a static 10.0.0.10/24 NIC that serves its own DNS, plus a DomainMember VM on a static 10.0.0.20/24 NIC whose DNS points at the DC so it can locate and join the domain. Both VMs reference the REAL prepared Windows Server base image (guest-configurable via its bootstrap profile) so the V2 plan requires guest work - DC promotion and a domain join - and can only start once the local bootstrap credential slot is filled. Only localBootstrap is authored on each VM; the planner reuses it for domain-admin, domain-join and DSRM. Safe to delete.",
